  "body": "Nestled within the thriving and highly sought-after Strathmill community, this beautifully crafted newly built home offers the perfect blend of contemporary style, comfort, and low-maintenance living. Upstairs, you'll find four generously sized bedrooms, including a private master retreat complete with its own elegant ensuite. A stylish family bathroom services the remaining bedrooms, providing both convenience and modern appeal. Downstairs, the light-filled open-plan living area has been thoughtfully designed for effortless everyday living and entertaining. At the heart of the home is a stunning designer kitchen featuring premium Fisher & Paykel appliances, quality tapware, and an elegant stone benchtop. Beautiful timber flooring and a feature ceiling light add warmth and sophistication, while seamless indoor-outdoor flow leads to a spacious deck, perfect for family gatherings, summer barbecues, or relaxing in the sunshine.\r\nAdditional Features:\r\n*\tCentral air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n*\tBuilt-in sound system for enhanced entertainment\r\n*\tExcellent two-level layout ideal for families, guests, or extended family living\r\n*\t10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\nPerfectly positioned in one of Orewa's fastest-growing and most desirable neighbourhoods, you'll enjoy convenient access to motorway connections, local shops, Silverdale Shopping Centre, and the wider retail precinct. Best of all, the golden sands of Orewa Beach are just moments away, allowing you to embrace the very best of coastal living.\r\nThis is an outstanding opportunity to secure a stylish, move-in-ready home in a premium location. Highly motivated vendors are committed to selling and welcome your interest. Opportunities like this are rare, so act quickly to secure your place in this sought-after coastal community. Don't miss out. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing.\r\nTo view documentation relating to this property, copy and paste the following link into your browser: \r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/JAU4",
